  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Enhancement; <strong>CL</strong> 1st<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 400 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>This grey stone is supernaturally effective at honing power of various weapons - including, oddly, blunt weapons like hammers that do not have an edge to sharpen. Once per day, as a standard action, a creature can use a sharpening stone to give a weapon a +1 enhancement bonus for one round per caster level. This overlaps (and does not stack with) any existing enhancement bonus on an item. Calculate the duration of this effect starting from the end of the user’s turn (so the enhancement, at the base level, wears off at the end of the character’s next round, ensuring at least one round of use).</p>\n<p><strong>Flask Shard Effect:</strong> Increase this item’s caster level to the next increment of 4, increase its uses per day by 1, and increase the enhancement bonus by +1. <strong>Flask Shard Limit:</strong> +4</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Enhancement sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 200 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc74\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
